# BIOS Keys by Manufacturer

> Press the key repeatedly immediately after powering on the PC.

| Brand            | BIOS Key                 | Boot Menu (if available) |
|------------------|--------------------------|--------------------------|
| ASUS             |        Del / F2          |Esc(laptops) / f8(desktop)|
| Gigabyte         |           Del            |          F12             |
| MSI              |           Del            |          F11             |
| ASRock           |        Del / F2          |          F11             |
| Acer             |        F2  / Del         |          F12             |
| Dell             |            F2            |          F12             |
| HP               |        Esc + F10         |       Esc + F9           |
| Lenovo (Desktop) |            F1            |          F12             |
| Lenovo (Laptop)  | F2 / Fn+F2 / Novo Button |    F12 / Novo Button     |
| Toshiba          |        F2 / Esc          |          F12             |
| Samsung          |            F2            |       F12 / Esc          |
| Sony (VAIO)      |            F2            |    Assistance Button     |
| Alienware        |            F2            |          F12             |
| Biostar          |            Del           |          F9              |
| Zotac            |            Del           |        F8 / F11          |
| Razer            |        F1 / Del          |           -              |
| Intel            |            F2            |          F10             |

Tip: If the key doesn't work, restart and try pressing it repeatedly as soon as you power on the computer.


  
